%% Executive methodology flowchart — business headline first, one muted method line
%% baked into each box. Colours carry meaning and each box's small caption states it:
%%   blue = prepare the data · gold = the deliverable · violet = prove it works ·
%%   green = in your hands · dashed red = what we need from PAL
%% Import into Lucidchart: Insert > Diagram as code > Mermaid (paste the flowchart below),
%% or use docs/exec-methodology-flowchart.drawio via File > Import Data > draw.io
%% (the .drawio version has the polished styling + legend — prefer it for slides).
%% Headline to place above the diagram in the slide/canvas:
%%   "How we segment PAL's customers — business logic decides, machine learning verifies"

flowchart LR
  A["<b>PREPARE THE DATA</b><br/><b>1 · Start with every ticket</b><br/>38 million ticket records, May 2024 – May 2027<br/>no personal or loyalty data required<br/><i>streamed at full scale with open-source tools;<br/>typed, cleaned, quality-flagged</i>"]
  B["<b>PREPARE THE DATA</b><br/><b>2 · Organise into trips and customers</b><br/>22.9M bookings across 13.4M customers<br/>one booking = one travel decision<br/><i>behaviour measured per booking: lead time,<br/>trip shape, routes, a 7-tier fare-value ladder</i>"]
  C["<b>THE DELIVERABLE</b><br/><b>3 · Sort every booking into<br/>10 customer segments</b><br/>transparent business rules — every assignment<br/>explainable in one sentence<br/>e.g. Corporate · Overseas Workers · Family Visits<br/><i>rules won on evidence: 10 clustering algorithms<br/>found no natural clusters — so rules assign,<br/>machine learning verifies</i>"]
  D["<b>PROVE IT WORKS</b><br/><b>4 · Stress-test the segments</b><br/>four independent studies confirm the segments<br/>are real, predictive, and stable<br/><i>distinct on evidence the rules never saw ·<br/>predict refunds &amp; rebooking · hold across<br/>a 12-month step</i>"]
  E["<b>IN YOUR HANDS</b><br/><b>5 · Deliver live dashboards</b><br/>interactive Power BI — every figure<br/>traceable back to source tickets<br/><i>all 38.1M rows reconciled on every build;<br/>drift monitoring specified</i>"]
  F["<b>WHAT WE NEED FROM YOU</b><br/><b>6 · PAL expert sign-off</b><br/>your commercial team reviews ~1,000 bookings<br/>to confirm the segment names fit the business<br/><i>scored on the business cost of each<br/>misclassification, not raw accuracy</i>"]

  A --> B --> C --> D --> E
  E -.-> F

